### Key Achievements
- ✅ Implemented missing GUMAS_Thermax ethics protocol
- ✅ Implemented Aurora_Core_Flowstate binding layer
- ✅ Discovered and documented VECTORCHAIN capsule architecture
- ✅ Created production-ready agent generation engine
- ✅ Built complete symbolic vector chain management system
- ✅ Generated deployment-ready artifacts with full integration

